# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deny-by-default. This repo is intended to contain ONLY hand-written RTL,
# constraints, scripts and docs. Everything else is ignored, then a short
# allowlist re-includes the files we actually publish.
#
# Rationale: this design was developed in an environment covered by an NDA.
# Vivado build artifacts embed absolute paths, machine names and account IDs,
# so they must never be committed. Deny-by-default means a stray copy into
# this tree is ignored rather than silently published.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

*

# --- allowlist -------------------------------------------------------------
!.gitignore
!README.md
!*/

!rtl/**/*.sv
!tb/**/*.sv
!constraints/**/*.xdc
!scripts/**/*.tcl
!scripts/**/*.sh
!docs/**/*.md

# MATLAB verification/reference models and COE-generation scripts. The
# scripts themselves are not NDA-sensitive; the memory-init data they
# operate on (.coe, test images) stays excluded below.
!MATLAB/**/*.m

# Xilinx IP *source* definitions only. The .xci is the configuration Vivado
# regenerates the core from -- it is stock Distributed Memory Generator setup,
# not proprietary content. Generated output products stay excluded below.
!ip/**/*.xci

# --- explicit denials (defence in depth; these win over the allowlist) ------

# Generated IP output products. The .xci sources are committed (allowlisted
# above); everything Vivado derives from them is not -- it is regenerable and
# embeds build-machine paths.
**/*.xcix
**/*.veo
**/*.vho
**/*.dcp
ip/**/synth/
ip/**/sim/
ip/**/hdl/
ip/**/*.xml

# Vivado project + run directories (contain absolute paths and account IDs)
*.xpr
*.jou
*.log
*.str
*.wdf
*.rpt
*.pb
*.dmp
*.bit
*.ltx
*.wcfg
.Xil/
*.cache/
*.gen/
*.hw/
*.ip_user_files/
*.runs/
*.sim/
*.srcs/

# Memory initialisation data (trained weights + test images).
# Withheld pending confirmation that the data is not NDA-covered.
# See README "What is deliberately not here".
*.coe

# Simulation working directories
sim_work/
build/
*.vvp
*.jou
*.wdb
xsim.dir/

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
*.swp
